<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Derivation</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Derivation of <a href="#S3.E9" title="In 3.2 Surrogate Reward Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">For simplicity and without loss of generality, we omit the conditioning on <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{c}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐜</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{c}}</annotation></semantics></math> throughout this derivation. By substituting the surrogate reward parameterization from <a href="#S3.E7" title="In 3.2 Surrogate Reward Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> into the Bradley-Terry objective in <a href="#S3.E8" title="In 3.2 Surrogate Reward Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, we obtain the initial training objective:</p>
<table id="A1.E12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E12X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle L(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle L(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{k}\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+},\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\log\sigma\Bigg(\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\beta w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\left[\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}+\log Z\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>σ</mi><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi>β</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{k}\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+},\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\log\sigma\Bigg(\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\beta w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\left[\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}+\log Z\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E12Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E12Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\beta w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\left[\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}+\log Z\right]\Bigg)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi>β</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>]</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\beta w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\left[\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}+\log Z\right]\Bigg).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">The partition function terms cancel because the weights sum to zero over the full group. Specifically, since the weights are defined as absolute normalized advantages and the partition into positive and negative groups is based on the sign of the advantage, we have <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})=\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}}A({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})=\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}}\frac{r({\mathbf{x}}_{k})-r_{mean}}{r_{std}}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})=\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}}A({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})=\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}}\frac{r({\mathbf{x}}_{k})-r_{mean}}{r_{std}}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{mean}=\frac{\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}}r({\mathbf{x}}_{k})}{|G|}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msub><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mstyle><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{mean}=\frac{\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}}r({\mathbf{x}}_{k})}{|G|}</annotation></semantics></math>. This simplifies the objective to:</p>
<table id="A1.E13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E13X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle L(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle L(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}^{+},\mathcal{G}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\log\sigma\Bigg(\beta\bigg[\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>σ</mi><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}^{+},\mathcal{G}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\log\sigma\Bigg(\beta\bigg[\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E13Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E13Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}\bigg]\Bigg)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}+1:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}\bigg]\Bigg).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Next, we decompose the trajectory-level log-ratio using the Markov property of the diffusion process. For any trajectory <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T}</annotation></semantics></math>, the joint distribution factorizes as a product of transition probabilities:</p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}=\sum_{t=t_{k}+1}^{T}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T})}=\sum_{t=t_{k}+1}^{T}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.2" class="ltx_p">Substituting this factorization and rewriting the sum over timesteps as an expectation, we obtain:</p>
<table id="A1.E15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E15X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle L(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle L(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}^{+},\mathcal{G}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\log\sigma\Bigg(\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathcal{U}[t_{k}+1,T]}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}),q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}^{+},\mathcal{G}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\log\sigma\Bigg(\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{t\sim\mathcal{U}[t_{k}+1,T]}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}),q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E15Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\bigg[\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\bigg]\Bigg)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\bigg[\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\bigg]\Bigg).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p5.2" class="ltx_p">To obtain a tractable upper bound, we apply Jensen’s inequality. Since <math id="A1.SS1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\log\sigma(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\log\sigma(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> is a convex function, moving the expectation over <math id="A1.SS1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})</annotation></semantics></math> inside the sigmoid yields:</p>
<table id="A1.E16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E16X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle L(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle L(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}^{+},\mathcal{G}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\mathbb{E}_{t,q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\Bigg[-\log\sigma\bigg(\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>σ</mi><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}^{+},\mathcal{G}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}}\mathbb{E}_{t,q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\Bigg[-\log\sigma\bigg(\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E16Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\Big[\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\Big]\bigg)\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\Big[\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\Big]\bigg)\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, we rewrite the log-ratios in terms of KL divergences. For any distribution <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> and models <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\phi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\phi}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\text{ref}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have the following identity:</p>
<table id="A1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}=\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)-\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>KL</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>KL</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}=\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)-\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p7.2" class="ltx_p">Substituting this identity and rearranging terms, we arrive at the final upper bound:</p>
<table id="A1.E18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E18X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle L(\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle L(\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+},\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}_{k},k}\mathbb{E}_{t,q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\sigma\Bigg(-\beta(T-t_{k})\bigg\{" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>σ</mi><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">{</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}_{(\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+},\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-})\sim\mathcal{D}_{k},k}\mathbb{E}_{t,q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\sigma\Bigg(-\beta(T-t_{k})\bigg\{</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E18Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\Big[\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)-\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>KL</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>KL</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{+}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\Big[\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)-\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E18Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\Big[\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)-\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)\Big]\bigg\}\Bigg)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>KL</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>KL</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">)</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\sum_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}\in\mathcal{G}_{k}^{-}}w({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\Big[\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)-\mathrm{KL}\big(q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})\|p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})\big)\Big]\bigg\}\Bigg).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">This completes the derivation of <a href="#S3.E9" title="In 3.2 Surrogate Reward Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Derivation of <a href="#S3.E11" title="In 3.3 Few-Step Generator Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a></h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compute the gradient of the objective in <a href="#S3.E10" title="In 3.3 Few-Step Generator Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> by separately deriving the gradients of the reward maximization and KL regularization terms.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 1: Reformulating the Surrogate Reward.</span>
We first re-write the surrogate reward defined in <a href="#S3.E7" title="In 3.2 Surrogate Reward Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> as follows:</p>
<table id="A1.E19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E19X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T}|{\mathbf{c}})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T}|{\mathbf{c}})}+\beta\log Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T}|{\mathbf{c}})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}:T}|{\mathbf{c}})}+\beta\log Z</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E19Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\sum_{t=t_{k}+1}^{T}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}+\beta\log Z." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\sum_{t=t_{k}+1}^{T}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}+\beta\log Z.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.3" class="ltx_p">By converting the summation over timesteps into an expectation with respect to a uniform distribution over <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq t_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq t_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain:</p>
<table id="A1.E20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E20X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}+\beta\log Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>log</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}+\beta\log Z</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E20Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}+\beta\log Z," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}+\beta\log Z,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.4" class="ltx_p">where the last equality follows from marginalizing the joint distribution <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k+1}:T}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})</annotation></semantics></math> to the relevant variables <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 2: Gradient of the Reward Term.</span>
Applying the chain rule through the reparameterized sampling process, the gradient of the reward term with respect to <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> is given by:</p>
<table id="A1.E21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E21X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\mathbb{E}_{k,p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\mathbb{E}_{k,p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{k,t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\left[\nabla_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\right]\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}{\partial\theta}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{k,t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\left[\nabla_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\right]\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}{\partial\theta}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.3" class="ltx_p">Since the forward diffusion process <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q({\mathbf{x}}_{t}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})</annotation></semantics></math> is Gaussian with <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{t}=\alpha_{t|t_{k}}{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}+\sigma_{t|t_{k}}\bm{\epsilon}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{t}=\alpha_{t|t_{k}}{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}+\sigma_{t|t_{k}}\bm{\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\epsilon}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐈</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\epsilon}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}=\alpha_{t|t_{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}=\alpha_{t|t_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Substituting this yields:</p>
<table id="A1.E22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E22X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\mathbb{E}_{k,p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>r</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\mathbb{E}_{k,p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\tilde{r}_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}},{\mathbf{c}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{k,t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\left[\alpha_{t|t_{k}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\right]\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}{\partial\theta}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta(T-t_{k})\mathbb{E}_{k,t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\left[\alpha_{t|t_{k}}\nabla_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}\right]\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}{\partial\theta}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.4" class="ltx_p">Note that the gradient with respect to <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log Z</annotation></semantics></math> vanishes since the partition function is independent of <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbf{x}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbf{x}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 3: Gradient of the KL Regularization Term.</span>
The gradient of the marginal-level KL divergence term follows from <a href="#S2.E2" title="In 2 Preliminaries ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Step 4: Combining the Gradients.</span>
Combining the results from Steps 2 and 3, and incorporating the negative sign from the reward maximization term in <a href="#S3.E10" title="In 3.3 Few-Step Generator Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, we arrive at the final gradient expression:</p>
<table id="A1.E23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E23X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}L(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>L</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}L(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{k,t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\Bigg[" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\mathbb{E}_{k,t\geq t_{k}}\mathbb{E}_{p_{\theta}({\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\mathbb{E}_{q({\mathbf{x}}_{t},{\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}})}\Bigg[</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E23Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta\alpha_{t|t_{k}}(T-t_{k})\nabla_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo fence="false">|</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta\alpha_{t|t_{k}}(T-t_{k})\nabla_{{\mathbf{x}}_{t}}\log\frac{p_{\phi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}{p_{\text{ref}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t-1}|{\mathbf{x}}_{t})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E23Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\beta_{g}\lambda_{t}\left(s_{\text{fake}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t})-s_{\psi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t})\right)\Bigg]\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}{\partial\theta}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>g</mi></msub><mi>λ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>fake</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\beta_{g}\lambda_{t}\left(s_{\text{fake}}({\mathbf{x}}_{t})-s_{\psi}({\mathbf{x}}_{t})\right)\Bigg]\frac{\partial{\mathbf{x}}_{t_{k}}}{\partial\theta},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.2" class="ltx_p">which completes the derivation of <a href="#S3.E11" title="In 3.3 Few-Step Generator Learning ‣ 3 Method ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Experiment details</h2>

<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Visual Text Rendering</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Adopting the evaluation protocol from TextDiffuser <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib72" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2023</a>)</cite> and the experimental framework of Flow-GRPO, we assess how accurately models can render textual content within generated images. Prompts follow a standardized template: “A sign that says ‘text”’, where ‘text’ denotes the target string to be visually rendered. Text fidelity <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib73" title="" class="ltx_ref">Gong et al., 2025</a>)</cite> is computed as:</p>
<table id="A2.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=\max(1-N_{e}/N_{\text{ref}},0)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=\max(1-N_{e}/N_{\text{ref}},0)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Here, <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{e}</annotation></semantics></math> represents the minimum edit distance between the rendered output and the target text, while <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{\text{ref}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math> indicates the character length of the quoted string in the prompt.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Setup Details</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">During training, we generate 24 samples per group. We employ Flow-DPM-Solver <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib70" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xie et al., 2025</a>)</cite> with 4 sampling steps for both training rollouts and inference. We apply LoRA fine-tuning with rank 32, and set <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=100</annotation></semantics></math> as the default. Our default choice of <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{g}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{g}</annotation></semantics></math> is set such that the ratio of the gradient of the reward term to the gradient of the KL regularization term is <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2:1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2:1</annotation></semantics></math>. All experiments are conducted at 512 resolution, with GPU hours reported in A100 equivalents.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Details of the out-of-domain evaluation metrics</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We describe the specific out-of-domain metrics employed for quality assessment. The <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">aesthetic score</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib42" title="" class="ltx_ref">Schuhmann et al., 2022</a>)</cite> uses a CLIP-based linear regression model to quantify the visual appeal of generated images. To evaluate image quality degradation, we employ the <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DeQA score</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib74" title="" class="ltx_ref">You et al., 2025</a>)</cite>, which utilizes a multimodal large language model architecture to measure how various imperfections—such as distortions, textural degradation, and low-level visual artifacts—affect overall perceived image quality.
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ImageReward</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib76" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kirstain et al., 2023</a>)</cite> assesses both visual quality and text-image correspondence, offering a holistic evaluation of generation quality from a human-centered standpoint.
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ImageReward</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xu et al., 2023</a>)</cite> functions as a comprehensive human preference model for text-to-image generation, evaluating multiple aspects including text-visual coherence and generation fidelity. Lastly, <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">UnifiedReward</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib77" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2025a</a>)</cite> represents a state-of-the-art advancement in this domain. This unified reward framework is capable of evaluating both multimodal understanding and generation tasks, and has achieved superior performance on human preference assessment benchmarks compared to prior methods.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Additional Qualitative Comparison</h2>

<figure id="A3.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2603.07700v1/compare_ocr.png" id="A3.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/309;" width="476" height="309" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 10</span>: </span><span id="A3.F10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparisons of TDM-R1 against competing baselines. The same initial noise is used to generate all images.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present additional visual comparison in <a href="#A3.F10" title="In Appendix C Additional Qualitative Comparison ‣ TDM-R1: Reinforcing Few-Step Diffusion Models with Non-Differentiable Reward" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</article>
</div>
